{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-gearShopMerdoyo-2910": "MERCHANT: 城里又有新货到了，要看看吗？",
  "line:08119dc": "Innkeeper: 住一晚只要二十五瓦尔。",
  "line:004aa9a": "在旅馆休息",
  "line:09e1987": "Innkeeper: 看来您的钱还差一点。",
  "line:01304b6": "不了，谢谢……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdGossip1-2915": "MAN: 信件？当然会从这里经过，不过不归我管。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdGossip1-2916": "MAN: 有几个走陆路的商人说，西南方的半岛上，有座废弃的农庄。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdGossip1-2917": "MAN: 我们就搭了我兄弟的快帆船，想去看看那农庄还有什么剩下，可到了那边，连房子的影子都没见着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdCaravanGuard-2918": "MAN: 这里只存放商队的货物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdGearTrav-2919": "MAN: 这边可不太平，要买点东西防身，来这儿就对了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdGearTrav-2920": "MAN: 法师？去旅馆找找吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdEntryMerch-2921": "MERCHANT: 这镇子是乱了点，可做买卖很合适，谁知道会碰上什么人呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdEntryMerch-2922": "MERCHANT: 找法师？前阵子来过一个，就是有点……古怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdEntryBarb-2923": "BARBARIAN: 南边大城来的人？问左边屋子里的奴隶贩子去，他认识各路人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdEntryBarb-2924": "BARBARIAN: 你们在这里做买卖，还是往南走？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-pierMerchant-2925": "MAN: 那人最远能把船开到北边的山区，主要做毛皮生意，偶尔也载客。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdWaitBarb-2926": "MAN: 不，我们部落不送信。纸太难防潮了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdWaitBarb-2927": "MAN: 洪水让河涨太高。我该护送的商队，还没到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-convoyMan-2928": "MERCHANT: 塞伦来的人，多半到这里就不再往前走了，东南边的商人可不喜欢我们进他们的城。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-convoyMan-2929": "MERCHANT: 找法师？镇上好像有一个，不知道在哪儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-convoyWife-2930": "WOMAN: 再跑一两趟，就能退休了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdoyoMom-2931": "WOMAN: 我等丈夫。洪水退下去，他的商队就快来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdCoupleGuy-2932": "MAN: 窍门就是只带收音机里头的电子元件，重的都是外壳。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdCoupleGirl-2933": "WOMAN: 丈夫要是跑长途生意，你就得跟着，免得他在每座城都给自己找个老婆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdLookout-2934": "MAN: 又是你？看来找到法师了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdLookout-2935": "MAN: 这个季节商队走得慢，不过这几天应该会有几队到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdBenSignpost-2936": "MAN: 阿科斯来的人？这里多着呢，找个商人问问吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdBenSignpost-2937": "MAN: 这里有个东南半岛来的风系法师，比起平常那些，他没那么……文雅。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdInnGuy-2938": "MAN: 这地方谈不上豪华……可在车上睡久了，总会腻的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdInnWoman-2939": "OLD WOMAN: 你居然还活着，真叫人意外。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdInnWoman-2940": "OLD WOMAN: 他可真是……有意思，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdInnMan-2941": "OLD MAN: 我们见过吗？不记得了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdInnMan-2942": "OLD MAN: 你还是去找找同伴吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-barBarb1-2943": "BARBARIAN: 唉，去年的酒更好，不过我还是喝醉了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-barBarb1-2944": "BARBARIAN: 怎么试，我们都酿不出这么好的酒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-barBarb2-2945": "BARBARIAN: 是啊，雨多的年份，酒就差些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-barBarb2-2946": "BARBARIAN: 你以为，我们为什么没烧镇子、剥人头皮？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdBarGuy-2947": "MAN: 有本地人在旁边，我就喝不痛快，我敢说，他们给商队当护卫就是为了赚酒钱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdItemGuy-2948": "MAN: 这里主要卖旅途用品，想买些货去做生意，得直接找商队老板。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdItem2-2949": "WOMAN: 信件？南边来的男人？问问中间屋子里的奴隶贩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdItem2-2950": "WOMAN: 别跟我讲价。这里样样已经便宜。难道你还有别的地方买？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdResWife-2951": "WOMAN: 你们是塞伦来的？我们几年前从那儿搬过来的，结果住在这儿，见儿孙的次数反倒比从前多了一倍。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdResWife-2952": "WOMAN: 要说有什么舍不得的，还是塞伦的浴室啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdResHusband-2953": "MAN: 收起那副自命清高的样子，再来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdResHusband-2954": "MAN: 不收钱的话，我只肯说这些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdResHusband-2955": "MAN: 我正打算扩建房子，还要在镇子边上添几座马厩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdResHusband-2956": "MAN: 这里盖房子倒不需要什么许可，也不用地契，就是建材不太好弄。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-grasslandsBarbGuide-2957": "CARAVAN GUARD: 有人把草原清出来了，可现在各部落又打成一团。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-grasslandsBarbGuide-2958": "CARAVAN GUARD: 等我的亲族来，带我们回家。现在草原上，野兽太多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-grasslandsCowboyGuide-2959": "CARAVAN GUIDE: 荒野仍然危险，做生意的成本也就降不下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-grasslandsCowboyGuide-2960": "CARAVAN GUIDE: 我们在河北边耽搁太久，错过了赶路的好时候。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-grasslandsCowboyGuide-2961": "CARAVAN GUIDE: 魔兽一旦迁来，人少的话根本没法安全穿过这条山谷。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-grasslandsSafari-2962": "TOURIST: 水潭附近的草丛里有动静，听着像是个……很大的家伙。你要是也听见了，最好赶紧跑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-grasslandsMerchant-2963": "MERCHANT: 反正还困在这里，要买点什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler4-2964": "WOMAN: 说来惭愧，出发前我一直拖拖拉拉，不愿意跑这一趟。可等亲眼见到那些幻影……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler4-2965": "WOMAN: 那样的景象我这辈子都没见过，幸好这一趟还是来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler3-2966": "BARBARIAN: 他们都去看幽影。我不往鬼魂堆里去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler3-2967": "BARBARIAN: 你们穿过了河马山谷？安全吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler2-2968": "MAN: 我特意带了这种新出的彩色胶卷，想来拍尼巴罗斯山，以前可只有黑白照片。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler2-2969": "MAN: 我也试着拍了这里出现的幻影，可冲出来一看，底片上根本没留下它们的影子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler1-2970": "MAN: 我们还在等向导的族人过来，凑够人手，再一起回南边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler5-2971": "MAN: 我父亲是研究希纳尔历史的教授，所以我一直想来看看这些遗迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler5-2972": "MAN: 可那些幻影……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTraveler6-2973": "WOMAN: 别跟缄默者说话了，他们这么叫可不是没原因的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentWoman-2974": "WOMAN: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentMan-2975": "MAN: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-impatientMan-2976": "MAN: 星期一我就得回城里……那些向导到底什么时候来！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-impatientBride-2977": "WOMAN: 我们在度蜜月，玩得还挺开心，不过我丈夫大概已经急着想回文明世界了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeSignpost-2978": "MAN: 找科尔丁神父？他一般就在那两座神殿中的一座里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeSignpost-2979": "MAN: 有事找他就赶紧去，幻影就要出现了，可别错过那场面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTravelerA-2981": "WOMAN: 我在学院念过几年书，可这么厉害的幻象，还真从没见过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeTravelerB-2982": "MAN: 就等圣山的影子掠过了，到时候才有好戏看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2983": "BARBARIAN: 嗯，不错，守护者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2984": "BARBARIAN: 既然拿着酋长的武器，你就有资格参加这里的试炼。要试试吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2985": "不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2986": "等等，是什么试炼？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2987": "BARBARIAN: 只有通过试炼的人，才有资格拿神威标枪，这是祖先传下来的规矩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2988": "BARBARIAN: 要拿到它，就得一路打穿洞穴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2989": "BARBARIAN: 试炼期间，不许更换装备，也不许使用任何物品。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2990": "BARBARIAN: 最大的挑战在尽头等着你。必须在时限内完成整场试炼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2991": "是，我准备好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2992": "BARBARIAN: 很好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian1-2993": "BARBARIAN: 这里不是你该来的地方，germa。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian2-2994": "BARBARIAN: 现在可以进去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-caveBarbarian2-2995": "BARBARIAN: 得有酋长的武器，才能进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-captainMerdoyo-2996": "CAPTAIN: 带相机和书的人？对，我把他一路送到了修道院，他还没回来呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-captainMerdoyo-2997": "CAPTAIN: 南边来的人？我就是靠送这种人去上游吃饭的，你得说清楚点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-captainMerdoyo-2998": "CAPTAIN: 想坐船去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-durandalArchaeo-2999": "ARCHAEOLOGIST: 我是来寻找一柄著名的家传宝剑的。据记载，它最后一位主人在对抗科尔辛的战争期间，曾驻扎在这座修道院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-durandalArchaeo-3000": "ARCHAEOLOGIST: 听说那柄剑上有一种特殊附魔，后来莱奥尼亚从历史中消失，这种附魔也跟着失传了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-laterSiopeGuard-3001": "BARBARIAN: 别告诉领队，不过这里真有宝藏，早被哪个部落拿走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-laterTraveler2-3002": "MAN: 据说，出钱资助我们这次考察的人，跟那柄古剑当年的主人有亲缘关系。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-laterTraveler2-3003": "MAN: 他们一家如今住在塞伦，不过祖上来自莱奥尼亚海峡沿岸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-kordyneDialogueLater-3004": "KORDYNE: 乔尔乔斯？对，你们大概还追得上，他正试着攀登东北边那条崖道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-kordyneDialogueLater-3005": "KORDYNE: 一路平安。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeMisser1-3006": "MAN: 幻象都不见了，可去年还那么壮观呢……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeMisser2-3007": "WOMAN: 今年什么都看不着，幸好我妹妹没跟着来，省得白跑一趟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-siopeMisser2-3008": "WOMAN: 也不知道那些幽灵都去了哪儿，又为什么突然不见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-c11captive1-3009": "BOY: 我只想回家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-c11captive1-3010": "BOY: 我想回那个家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-banditGoBack-3011": "CORDELIA: 盘踞这里的禁术可能还没消散，不值得冒险试探。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-merdoyoEvadeTome-3012": "找到闪避宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentOraclePlayer-3013": "MAN: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentOraclePlayer-3014": "那人指了指你的神谕牌，想玩一局吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentOraclePlayer-3015": "不了，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentOraclePlayer-3016": "来一局！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentOraclePlayer-3017": "MAN: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentOraclePlayer-3018": "获得魔力宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/merdoyoNpcs.yarn-silentOraclePlayer-3019": "MAN: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3338": "Title: 寻找法师",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3339": "Description: 在边地商镇寻找一位法师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3340": "Title: 准备启程",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3341": "Description: 在码头与本会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3342": "Title: 上船！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3343": "Description: 找船长交谈，乘船北上前往修道院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3344": "Title: 草原",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3345": "Description: 杀出一条穿越草原的路，抵达修道院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3346": "Title: 人称神父",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3347": "Description: 与科尔丁交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3348": "Title: 不让人省心的同伴",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3349": "Description: 找到本，确认他没有惹出麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3350": "Title: 山影蔽日",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3351": "Description: 看看大家都聚到哪里去了。"
}
